<title>UK: Metals mixed at close, LME less active.</title>
<headline>Metals mixed at close, LME less active.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Closes slightly higher, restrained at $2,400 level. Spread slightly softer.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Ends easier after struggling overhead.</p>
<p>ZINC - Finishes steady after touching new 4-1/2 year peak.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Closes higher, maintains uptick.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Finish lower.</p>
</text>
